#. Key:	CS_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
#: /Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
msgctxt "ActiveSkill_Detail,CS_A"
msgid "단일 적에게 {0}의 물리 피해를 가하는 탄환을 발사합니다. 만약 적이 죽는다면 쿨타임이 2초 감소합니다."
msgstr "Fires a bullet that deals {0} physical damage to a single enemy. On kill, reduces the cooldown by 2 seconds."

#. Key:	CS_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
#: /Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
msgctxt "ActiveSkill_Detail,CS_B"
msgid "단일 적에게 {0}의 물리 피해를 가하는 탄환을 발사합니다."
msgstr "Fires a bullet that deals {0} physical damage to a single enemy."

