#: /Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
msgctxt "ActiveSkill_Detail,EC_A"
msgid "범위 내 아군들이 5초간 {0}의 실드와 {1}의 공격력, {2}의 스킬 위력을 얻고, 액티브 스킬의 쿨타임이 1초 감소합니다."
msgstr "Allies in range gain a {0} shield, +{1} attack power, and +{2} skill power for 5 seconds. Reduces the cooldown of active skills by 1 second."

#. Key:	EC_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
#: /Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
msgctxt "ActiveSkill_Detail,EC_B"
msgid "범위 내 아군들이 5초간 {0}의 실드와 {1}의 공격력, {2}의 스킬 위력을 얻습니다."
msgstr "Allies in range gain a {0} shield, +{1} attack power, and +{2} skill power for 5 seconds."

#. Key:	FS_A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
#: /Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
msgctxt "ActiveSkill_Detail,FS_A"
