msgstr "A projectile bounces between allies and enemies up to 5 times, healing allies for {0} and damaging enemies for {1} on each hit. Healing and damage increase by 15% per bounce."

#. Key:	FS_B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
#: /Game/StringTables/ActiveSkill/ActiveSkill_detail.ActiveSkill_detail
